    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Bulk Sort Attributes for WooCommerce is a WooCommerce extension that allows you to bulk<br />\norder WooCommerce attributes by ID, Name, or Name (Numeric). When there are<br />\nhundreds or even dozens of items in an attribute it becomes tedious and time<br />\nconsuming to sort by hand. This plugin makes it an easy task!</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Unzip the plugin file and extract the folder.</li>\n<li>Upload the bulk-sort-attributes-for-woocommerce folder to the /wp-content/plugins/ directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.2 &#8211; 08/08/2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Refactored and tightened sanitation checks.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.5 &#8211; 04/03/2024</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added icon and banner</li>\n<li>Confirmed compatibility with WP v6.5</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.4 &#8211; 03/28/2024</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added screenshots</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.3 &#8211; 03/27/2024</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bumped Version</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.2 &#8211; 10/16/2023</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added nonce.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested compatibility.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested compatibility.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First public release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Bulk sort WooCommerce attributes when they are too numerous for custom sorting by hand.",
